      "Ans": "I have completed the measurement of four spectra arranged in a 2x2 layout based on the current microscope view.\n\n### 1. Experiment Objective\nThe objective was to select four arbitrary regions in a 2x2 grid from the camera image, move the stage to those positions, and acquire one Raman spectrum at each point.\n\n### 2. Measurement Conditions\n*   **Laser Power:** 10%\n*   **Exposure Time:** 0.2 seconds\n*   **Acquisition Mode:** Single shot\n*   **Grid Layout (Pixel Coordinates):**\n    *   Top-Left: (400, 300)\n    *   Top-Right: (660, 300)\n    *   Bottom-Left: (400, 500)\n    *   Bottom-Right: (660, 500)\n\n### 3. Summary of Results\nFour spectra were successfully acquired and saved:\n\n| Point | Pixel Coord | Stage Position (mm) | Max Intensity | Sum Intensity | File Name |\n| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |\n| 1 | (400, 300) | (37.925, 25.212) | 1065.0 | 683,903.0 | `200432_800_x37.925_y25.212.csv` |\n| 2 | (660, 300) | (37.873, 25.175) | 984.0 | 675,049.0 | `200440_401_x37.873_y25.175.csv` |\n| 3 | (400, 500) | (37.925, 25.212) | 1055.0 | 676,475.0 | `200448_256_x37.925_y25.212.csv` |\n| 4 | (660, 500) | (37.873, 25.249) | 947.0 | 672,731.0 | `200455_993_x37.873_y25.249.csv` |\n\n### 4. Conclusion\nThe requested measurements were performed successfully. The intensity levels across the four points are relatively consistent, suggesting a uniform substrate or sample background in the selected regions. No saturation was observed at the chosen power and exposure settings.",
